  "privacyDataLead": "This website collects no personal data whatsoever.",
  "privacyDataTitle": "Data Collection",
  "privacyHow1": "Ra-Thor is a mercy-gated symbolic lattice. When you use the connected demos (Grok or X integrations), those interactions are governed by the respective platforms’ (xAI / X Corp) privacy policies.",
  "privacyHow2": "When you use <strong class=\"text-amber-300\">Sovereign Shard v8</strong> or <a href=\"/chat.html\" class=\"text-amber-300 underline\">Lattice Chat</a> (workspace 14.15.6), <strong class=\"text-amber-300\">the session store stays on your device</strong>. Optional encryption never leaves the browser. Bridging to Grok / X / another cloud model is explicit and then follows that provider’s policy.",
  "privacyHowTitle": "How Ra-Thor Works",
  "privacyLead": "Nothing we control leaves this device.",
  "privacyOverview1": "Ra-Thor (rathor.ai) is designed with a fundamental commitment to user sovereignty and privacy. This website and all associated sovereign shards operate under strict principles of minimal data collection and maximum user control.",
  "privacyOverview2": "Autonomicity Games Inc. respects your privacy and operates under the <strong class=\"text-amber-300\">TOLC 8 Mercy Gates</strong>.",
  "privacyOverviewTitle": "Overview",
  "privacyRight1": "<strong class=\"text-amber-300\">Right of access</strong> — Inspect local chat/session data via Developer Tools → Application → Local Storage for this origin.",
  "privacyRight2": "<strong class=\"text-amber-300\">Right to erasure</strong> — Clear site data or delete this origin’s localStorage at any time. Nothing is retained off-device.",
  "privacyRight3": "<strong class=\"text-amber-300\">Right to rectification</strong> — Edit or overwrite local session data in the chat interface or storage.",
  "privacyRight4": "<strong class=\"text-amber-300\">Right to data portability</strong> — Export sessions as JSON from the chat UI where available.",
  "privacyRight5": "<strong class=\"text-amber-300\">Right to object</strong> — Simply do not use optional chat features; the rest of the site requires zero data.",
  "privacyRightsLead": "Since no personal data is collected by this website, there is no personal data to access, correct, or delete on our servers. You retain full sovereignty over any local data:",
